From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:46:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] comsvcs: shared property groups, resource dispenser holder,
 "new" moniker, no-context exports

- SharedPropertyGroupManager: groups, properties (by name and by position), enumerator over the group names,
  IDispatch through the registered type library
- IHolder: tracks the resources it hands out (pool rated through the driver, FreeResource resets,
  Close destroys what is left), Track/Untrack/RequestDestroyResource
- "new" moniker: BindToStorage, ComposeWith, IsEqual, IsRunning, CommonPrefixWith, RelativePathTo,
  GetDisplayName, IROTData comparison data
- IDispenserManager::GetContext, GetObjectContext and CosGetCallContext report that there is no COM+ context
- todo_wine marks that now pass are removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

